1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,570
IN 1932,

2
00:00:01,570 --> 00:00:02,610
AUSTRALIA WENT TO WAR

3
00:00:02,610 --> 00:00:03,651
AGAINST BIRDS.

4
00:00:03,781 --> 00:00:04,505
AND LOST.

5
00:00:04,935 --> 00:00:06,135
AFTER WORLD WAR ONE,

6
00:00:06,135 --> 00:00:07,055
THE GOVERNMENT GAVE VETERANS

7
00:00:07,055 --> 00:00:07,475
FARMLAND

8
00:00:07,475 --> 00:00:09,037
IN WESTERN AUSTRALIA.

9
00:00:09,117 --> 00:00:10,337
THEN 20,000 EMUS

10
00:00:10,337 --> 00:00:10,817
SHOWED UP,

11
00:00:10,817 --> 00:00:11,737
AND STARTED EATING

12
00:00:11,737 --> 00:00:12,511
THE WHEAT.

13
00:00:12,641 --> 00:00:13,301
SO THE FARMERS

14
00:00:13,301 --> 00:00:14,665
CALLED THE ARMY.

15
00:00:14,745 --> 00:00:15,305
THE ARMY SENT

16
00:00:15,305 --> 00:00:15,845
ONE MAJOR,

17
00:00:15,845 --> 00:00:16,925
TWO SOLDIERS,

18
00:00:16,925 --> 00:00:17,985
TWO MACHINE GUNS,

19
00:00:17,985 --> 00:00:19,393
AND 10,000 BULLETS.

20
00:00:19,573 --> 00:00:20,213
THE EMUS SPLIT

21
00:00:20,213 --> 00:00:21,053
INTO TINY GROUPS,

22
00:00:21,053 --> 00:00:22,491
AND RAN OUT OF RANGE.

23
00:00:22,621 --> 00:00:23,361
WHEN 1,000 OF THEM

24
00:00:23,361 --> 00:00:24,041
FINALLY WALKED

25
00:00:24,041 --> 00:00:25,133
INTO AN AMBUSH...

26
00:00:25,313 --> 00:00:26,245
THE GUN JAMMED.

27
00:00:26,575 --> 00:00:27,115
SO THEY MOUNTED

28
00:00:27,115 --> 00:00:28,367
A GUN ON A TRUCK.

29
00:00:28,447 --> 00:00:29,047
THE EMUS WERE

30
00:00:29,047 --> 00:00:30,204
FASTER THAN THE TRUCK.

31
00:00:30,484 --> 00:00:31,324
BY DECEMBER:

32
00:00:31,324 --> 00:00:32,524
NEARLY 10,000 BULLETS,

33
00:00:32,524 --> 00:00:34,935
FOR 986 EMUS.

34
00:00:35,065 --> 00:00:35,505
TEN BULLETS

35
00:00:35,505 --> 00:00:36,381
PER BIRD.

36
00:00:36,711 --> 00:00:37,411
THE MAJOR'S REVIEW

37
00:00:37,411 --> 00:00:38,421
OF THE ENEMY?

38
00:00:42,289 --> 00:00:43,280
THE ARMY WENT HOME.

39
00:00:43,510 --> 00:00:43,856
THE EMUS

40
00:00:43,856 --> 00:00:44,559
DID NOT.

41
00:00:38,601 --> 00:00:41,689
"They can face machine guns with the invulnerability of tanks."
